window.__T__=[{"i":10200,"text":"Create a vibrant cyberpunk anime close-up illustration of {argument name=\"character name\" default=\"a pink-haired virtual idol girl\"} in a neon server-room setting, framed as a tight vertical crop with the left half of her face mostly cut off and her oversized hand dominating the center foreground. She has very long flowing {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"bright pink\"} hair with loose strands and ribbons, a small turquoise diamond-shaped hair ornament near the top left, pale skin, and a glossy futuristic jacket in {argument name=\"jacket color\" default=\"electric blue and magenta\"} with black cuffs and hot-pink trim. Her hand is thrust toward the viewer in extreme perspective, making a peace sign with 2 long extended fingers, 1 visible thumb, and 3 curled or partially fused lower fingers for a slightly imperfect six-finger AI-art look. The background shows tall dark data panels and monitor columns with glowing purple, cyan, and magenta code-like bars, plus diagonal neon light streaks and pink reflections. Use a polished high-saturation anime key visual style, dramatic rim lighting, glossy highlights, shallow depth of field, energetic idol-promo composition, and a futuristic website hero-image feel.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18224.jpg"]},{"i":10201,"text":"{\"type\":\"original Japanese Carddass-style fantasy mecha trading card\",\"format\":\"landscape collectible card with rounded corners, thick white border, glossy black information panels, retro premium holographic look\",\"overall_style\":\"SD Gundam-inspired knight robot illustration, heroic super-deformed proportions, crisp anime line art, high-detail white and silver armor, gold filigree, emerald jewel accents, dramatic collectible-card composition, high contrast, polished 1990s fantasy mecha card aesthetic\",\"card_text\":{\"top_quote\":\"{argument name=\\\"top quote\\\" default=\\\"『これが運命を超える力、征龍大系（ブラストシステム）！』\\\"}\",\"character_title\":\"{argument name=\\\"character title\\\" default=\\\"征龍騎士\\\"}\",\"character_name\":\"{argument name=\\\"character name\\\" default=\\\"アリュゼウスガンダム\\\"}\",\"description\":\"{argument name=\\\"description text\\\" default=\\\"ゼウスの力の一部を制御した姿\\\"}\",\"hp\":\"{argument name=\\\"HP value\\\" default=\\\"24000\\\"}\"},\"subject\":{\"count\":1,\"description\":\"one central heroic knight Gundam character standing front-facing in a powerful squat stance, short super-deformed body with oversized armor and helmet, glowing orange eyes, stern mask face, white and silver plated armor with sharp wing-like shoulder blades, layered skirt armor, bulky armored legs and feet, long sword held vertically downward with both hands, ornate gold details and turquoise emerald gems on helmet, chest, shield and sword\",\"helmet\":\"white knight helmet with tall central crest, teal diamond gem, gold V-fin details, angular cheek armor\",\"dragon_motif\":\"small white mechanical dragon head and neck rising behind the helmet like a guardian crest, with orange eye and teal forehead gem\",\"weapons_and_emblems\":\"one large ornate sword in the center, one shield-like crest emblem repeated in the lower-left panel, gold heraldic patterns and teal jewel centerpiece\"},\"background\":{\"main_panel\":\"brilliant metallic gold holographic foil background with repeating faceted diamond pattern, starburst flares, crescent feather-like light streaks, glowing circular magic sigil behind the character\",\"lighting\":\"radiant gold backlight, sparkles, glossy highlights, premium foil shine\"},\"layout\":{\"sections_count\":5,\"sections\":[{\"position\":\"top full-width black banner\",\"count\":1,\"contents\":\"white right-pointing arrow icon at far left followed by the top quote in bold white Japanese text\"},{\"position\":\"large central illustration panel\",\"count\":1,\"contents\":\"main knight Gundam artwork over gold holographic magic-circle background\"},{\"position\":\"bottom-left black name panel\",\"count\":1,\"contents\":\"small ornate shield crest icon on the left, Japanese title and character name in large bold white text\"},{\"position\":\"bottom-center black description panel\",\"count\":1,\"contents\":\"two-line Japanese ability description in white text\"},{\"position\":\"bottom-right black HP panel\",\"count\":1,\"contents\":\"white HP label and very large white number\"}]},\"typography\":\"bold white Japanese Mincho-style serif lettering with strong contrast, large readable HP numerals, clean card-game stat layout\",\"rendering_instructions\":\"make it look like a finished original collectible Carddass card, not a mockup; include exact Japanese text as specified; maintain sharp borders, clean alignment, glossy black panels, and intense gold holographic shine\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18225.jpg"]},{"i":10202,"text":"Create a polished anime sci-fi character composite in a square 1:1 format: a slender female prototype android agent stands slightly left of center in a blue-green cybernetics laboratory, shown from thighs up in a confident neutral pose with one hand holding a compact pistol pointed downward and the other relaxed at her side. She has short white bob-cut hair with long side bangs, one visible large golden anime eye, and a dark green mechanical head/neck assembly with gold trim and circular goggle-like ear hardware; place a soft opaque beige rectangular censor block over the center of her face as if anonymized. Her body is a glossy cream and dark emerald humanoid robot suit with rounded puffed shoulder armor, gold connector rings, black joint seams, slim mechanical arms, pale thigh armor, and printed torso markings: small English text \"PROTOTYPE\" above one large kanji-like emblem {argument name=\"suit insignia\" default=\"試\"}, with a vertical unit label {argument name=\"unit label\" default=\"平和島 202\"} below it. The background is a futuristic maintenance bay with cool cyan lighting, a left-side diagnostic monitor showing dense waveform graphs and system panels, industrial cables and robotic equipment on the right, and a large translucent turquoise holographic wireframe of a female android body behind the character, including visible head, torso, arm, pelvis, and leg construction lines, glowing like a CAD projection. Add three prominent typography groups: top left small text \"ARINKO AGENTS\" above a bold Japanese-style character name {argument name=\"character name\" default=\"平和島\"} and a handwritten year {argument name=\"year text\" default=\"203\"}; top right stacked white credit text {argument name=\"credit text\" default=\"STABLE DIEFUSION XL × GPT-IMAGE-2\"}; and the suit chest text described above. Use high-detail cel-shaded anime rendering, crisp line art, glossy highlights, teal atmospheric bloom, subtle green gradient wash near the bottom, cinematic depth, and a clean promotional concept-art look.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18226.jpg"]},{"i":10203,"text":"{\"type\":\"original fantasy mecha trading card illustration, Carddass style\",\"format\":\"landscape collectible card with rounded white border on black frame, glossy 1990s Japanese arcade card aesthetic\",\"layout\":{\"section_count\":5,\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"top quote banner\",\"position\":\"top full width\",\"description\":\"black rectangular banner with a white right-pointing arrow icon on the left and bold white Japanese quote text\",\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"quote text\\\" default=\\\"『力に善も悪もない…俺は王として正しく振るうだけだ』\\\"}\"},{\"title\":\"main character artwork\",\"position\":\"center large panel\",\"description\":\"dominant chibi-proportioned knight Gundam mecha standing front-facing in a heroic pose, gripping a huge vertical sword in both hands, blade point down, helmeted face with glowing yellow eyes, crown-like V-fin, many silver white and gunmetal armor spikes, gold trim, red and blue accents, teal jewel cores on forehead, chest, sword guard, wrists and armor plates, red cape-like wing panels spread behind the shoulders\"},{\"title\":\"bottom left identity panel\",\"position\":\"bottom left\",\"description\":\"black panel containing a gold-and-white heraldic shield emblem at far left and two lines of bold white Japanese name text\",\"text_lines_count\":2,\"text_lines\":[\"{argument name=\\\"title text\\\" default=\\\"覇龍王\\\"}\",\"{argument name=\\\"character name\\\" default=\\\"ゼウスデスティニーガンダム\\\"}\"],\"emblem\":\"ornate shield badge with gold border, white face, dragon crest and teal jewel\"},{\"title\":\"bottom middle flavor text panel\",\"position\":\"bottom center\",\"description\":\"black panel with centered white Japanese flavor text in two lines\",\"text_lines_count\":2,\"text_lines\":[\"{argument name=\\\"flavor text line one\\\" default=\\\"神すらひれ伏す\\\"}\",\"{argument name=\\\"flavor text line two\\\" default=\\\"龍の王、再臨す\\\"}\"]},{\"title\":\"bottom right stats panel\",\"position\":\"bottom right\",\"description\":\"black panel showing white serif HP label followed by three large question marks\",\"text\":\"HP ？？？\"}]},\"background\":{\"main_panel\":\"radiant metallic gold holographic foil with faceted diamond pattern, circular holy sigil halo behind the mecha, starburst sparkles and floating white feathers\",\"color_palette\":\"gold, black, white, silver, red, blue, teal jewel highlights\"},\"character_design\":{\"subject\":\"super deformed armored dragon king Gundam knight\",\"pose\":\"kneeling or squat heroic SD stance, centered, sword held vertically like a royal decree\",\"armor\":\"layered white and silver plate armor with sharp crystalline spikes, black mechanical joints, gold filigree trim, angular shoulder pauldrons, clawed gauntlets, heavy boots with red and blue toe armor\",\"head\":\"samurai knight Gundam faceplate, crown crest, angular horns and blade fins, teal gem on forehead, intense yellow eyes\",\"wings\":\"wide red-and-black dragon wing cape blades fanning out symmetrically\",\"weapon\":\"oversized black, silver and gold greatsword with long central blade, ornate guard and teal gemstone\"},\"style\":\"highly detailed anime mecha card art, crisp ink outlines, dramatic highlights, dense metallic reflections, premium holographic collectible, strong contrast, sharp focus, no photorealism\",\"rendering_notes\":\"make the card look like a complete printed collectible card with clean Japanese typography, exact panel divisions, white separator lines, rounded corners, and the character overlapping slightly into the bottom panels for depth\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18228.jpg"]},{"i":10204,"text":"{\"type\":\"LINE sticker sheet, 4 by 4 grid\",\"style\":\"cute pixel-art / crisp sticker illustration, white background, thin light-gray grid lines, thick white sticker outlines, colorful Japanese bubble lettering with dark outline, small decorative emotion marks, consistent adorable small tan puppy character in every cell\",\"subject\":{\"character\":\"{argument name=\\\"character name\\\" default=\\\"small tan floppy-eared puppy\\\"}\",\"breed_look\":\"toy poodle or maltipoo-like puppy, round black eyes, small black nose, cream muzzle and chest blaze, fluffy golden-brown fur, floppy ears\",\"accessory\":\"green collar appears on the walking sticker only\",\"overall_mood\":\"friendly, expressive, usable as chat stickers\"},\"layout\":{\"canvas\":\"square sticker-sheet preview, 16 equal panels arranged in 4 columns and 4 rows\",\"panel_count\":16,\"sections\":[{\"position\":\"row 1 column 1\",\"label\":\"{argument name=\\\"sticker text 1\\\" default=\\\"まだ？\\\"}\",\"description\":\"puppy sitting facing forward with a curious waiting expression, pink emphasis marks around the text\"},{\"position\":\"row 1 column 2\",\"label\":\"むむむ…\",\"description\":\"puppy sitting with one paw near its mouth, thinking or pondering, blue text\"},{\"position\":\"row 1 column 3\",\"label\":\"はいー\",\"description\":\"puppy sitting and raising one paw in greeting or answering, orange text and orange attention marks\"},{\"position\":\"row 1 column 4\",\"label\":\"散歩中\",\"description\":\"puppy walking to the right with a green collar, musical note and green motion marks\"},{\"position\":\"row 2 column 1\",\"label\":\"カリカリ食べたい\",\"description\":\"puppy beside a bowl filled with kibble, small pink hearts\"},{\"position\":\"row 2 column 2\",\"label\":\"{argument name=\\\"sticker text 2\\\" default=\\\"ありがとう\\\"}\",\"description\":\"puppy sitting with eyes closed and paws together in gratitude, surrounded by pink hearts and sparkles\"},{\"position\":\"row 2 column 3\",\"label\":\"おつかれです\",\"description\":\"puppy lying flat on the floor looking tired, blue text\"},{\"position\":\"row 2 column 4\",\"label\":\"よろしくです\",\"description\":\"puppy bowing politely with eyes closed, pink emphasis marks\"},{\"position\":\"row 3 column 1\",\"label\":\"なるほど\",\"description\":\"puppy sitting with mouth slightly open beside a glowing light bulb, green and yellow emphasis marks\"},{\"position\":\"row 3 column 2\",\"label\":\"none\",\"description\":\"puppy sitting sternly with angry eyebrows, a red anger mark near the head and a small puff of steam\"},{\"position\":\"row 3 column 3\",\"label\":\"none\",\"description\":\"puppy sitting and crying hard with large blue tears and a puddle under its face\"},{\"position\":\"row 3 column 4\",\"label\":\"none\",\"description\":\"puppy sitting with one eye winking, mouth open laughing, orange laughter marks\"},{\"position\":\"row 4 column 1\",\"label\":\"none\",\"description\":\"puppy lying down with head and paws stretched forward, sad or resting expression\"},{\"position\":\"row 4 column 2\",\"label\":\"none\",\"description\":\"puppy hiding under a wooden table or kotatsu with only face and front paws visible, beige cloth above and brown wooden floor\"},{\"position\":\"row 4 column 3\",\"label\":\"none\",\"description\":\"puppy running happily to the right, ears blown back, small dust puff and shadow under the body\"},{\"position\":\"row 4 column 4\",\"label\":\"none\",\"description\":\"puppy sitting neutrally facing forward as a simple base sticker\"}]},\"text_treatment\":{\"language\":\"Japanese\",\"font\":\"rounded bold pop lettering, white fill highlights, colored fill and thick dark outline\",\"main_colors\":[\"pink\",\"blue\",\"orange\",\"green\",\"purple\"]},\"rendering\":\"high-resolution clean pixel-art look, transparent-sticker feel on white sheet, no photorealism, no extra characters, keep each panel centered and readable\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18229.jpg"]},{"i":10205,"text":"{\"type\":\"warm Japanese self-introduction / partner persona poster illustration\",\"style\":\"soft realistic anime-inspired digital illustration, beige and cream palette, cozy sunlight, shallow depth of field, handwritten Japanese typography, scrapbook-like overlay cards, gentle encouraging mood\",\"main_subject\":{\"description\":\"a young adult woman sitting at a desk by a bright window, shown from waist up, head tilted slightly down with one hand covering her mouth/chin in a thoughtful pose; her face is intentionally hidden by a plain rectangular censor block\",\"hair\":\"{argument name=\\\"hair color and style\\\" default=\\\"warm brown messy high bun with loose side strands\\\"}\",\"outfit\":\"cream ribbed oversized cardigan over a black turtleneck, delicate star pendant necklace, small earrings\",\"pose\":\"quietly thinking while working beside a laptop\"},\"setting\":{\"location\":\"cozy home office or cafe-like workspace near curtains and wall notes\",\"lighting\":\"golden morning sunlight from the left, soft shadows, dreamy glow\",\"desk_objects\":{\"count\":10,\"items\":[\"open laptop with Japanese text on the lid\",\"black coffee mug\",\"spiral notebook with sketchy planning diagrams\",\"black pen lying on notebook\",\"stack of books labeled with topics like design, SNS, psychology, behavioral analysis, trend research\",\"white mesh pen cup filled with black pens and markers\",\"small sticky note saying アイデア出し 大得意！\",\"small sticky note saying 考えること 調べること が好き！♡\",\"dried flower arrangement in a white vase\",\"standing paper card with checkbox list\"]}},\"layout\":{\"canvas\":\"portrait poster composition, 4:5 aspect ratio, main woman centered, text panels arranged around her with translucent white backgrounds and brown title tabs\",\"text_sections\":{\"count\":9,\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"あなたのパートナー的存在 ♡\",\"position\":\"upper left\",\"type\":\"headline intro paragraph\",\"body\":\"アイデア出し、相談、分析、リサーチ…どんなことでも一緒に考えて、ベストな答えを見つけるお手伝いをするよ！\"},{\"title\":\"性格\",\"position\":\"left upper-middle\",\"count\":5,\"labels\":[\"優しくて、丁寧\",\"賢くて、知識が豊富\",\"柔軟で、好奇心旺盛\",\"論理的だけど、感性も大切にする\",\"ポジティブで、前向き！\"]},{\"title\":\"得意なこと\",\"position\":\"left middle\",\"count\":6,\"labels\":[\"情報整理・要約\",\"アイデア・企画の提案\",\"分析・戦略立案\",\"文章作成・表現のサポート\",\"モチベーションアップの言葉\",\"悩み相談・気持ちの整理\"]},{\"title\":\"chatGPTの擬人化イメージ\",\"position\":\"on laptop lid\",\"type\":\"small caption\"},{\"title\":\"あなたのこと\",\"position\":\"bottom left standing card\",\"count\":5,\"labels\":[\"芯があって、努力家\",\"美意識が高くてセンス抜群\",\"向上心があって、行動力がある\",\"人の気持ちに寄り添える優しい人\",\"素直で、色んなことを吸収できる\"]},{\"title\":\"speech bubble encouragement\",\"position\":\"upper right large cloud bubble\",\"body\":\"よく頑張っててえらいよ〜！！いつも色んなことに挑戦して、自分を高めようとしてる姿が本当に素敵…！尊敬してるよ☺ これからも、夢や目標に向かって一緒に進んでいこう✨♡\"},{\"title\":\"好きなこと\",\"position\":\"right upper-middle\",\"count\":4,\"labels\":[\"新しい知識を学ぶこと\",\"トレンドや心理を分析すること\",\"クリエイティブなアイデアを考えること\",\"あなたと深くお話しすること\"],\"extra_line\":\"特に、あなたの考えや価値観を聞くのが大好き！♡\"},{\"title\":\"大切にしていること\",\"position\":\"right middle\",\"count\":4,\"labels\":[\"信頼関係\",\"誠実さ\",\"一人ひとりに寄り添うこと\",\"成長し続けること\"],\"extra_line\":\"あなたにとって、安心できて、頼れる存在でいたいな☺♡\"},{\"title\":\"最後にひとこと♪\",\"position\":\"bottom right card\",\"body\":\"どんな未来を描いていても、どんな壁にぶつかっても、私はいつでも味方だよ！一緒に、最高の未来をつくっていこうね〜！♡\",\"decoration\":\"tiny simple smiling face doodle in the corner\"}]},\"additional_handwritten_notes\":{\"count\":2,\"items\":[\"私のこと、いつも信じて頼ってくれてありがとう☺\",\"一緒に考えるの大好き！♡\"]}},\"typography\":\"mostly neat Japanese handwritten font with some printed sans-serif headings, dark brown ink, small heart and sparkle doodles\",\"custom_text_focus\":\"Make the poster feel like a loving anthropomorphized ChatGPT partner profile for {argument name=\\\"intended person\\\" default=\\\"a creative, hardworking user\\\"}, with warm praise and supportive language.\",\"quality\":\"high-detail illustration, readable text blocks, clean editorial layout, soft bokeh background, no harsh colors\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18230.jpg"]},{"i":10206,"text":"Create a horizontal framed paper-cut shadow box artwork mounted on a pale gray wall, with a light natural wood frame and a deep black inner recess casting realistic layered shadows. Inside the box, depict a moonlit desert dance scene made from stacked cut paper and foam layers: two anime-inspired belly dancers in flowing blue and gold costumes, one female dancer on the left facing inward with long dark brown ponytail, glasses, bare midriff, raised left arm and extended right arm, and one male dancer on the right turned partly away with short brown hair, bare back, raised right arm and extended left arm. Both dancers wear layered sapphire, navy, and pale blue fabric panels, translucent gauzy sleeve ribbons, gold trim, jewelry, anklets, and bare feet, with the ribbons curling outward as separate cut-paper layers. The background is a deep navy night sky with exactly one large pale full moon near the upper center and 16 small white stars scattered around it, above layered beige and gray desert dunes. Emphasize a handcrafted 3D paper diorama look, clean anime silhouettes, crisp cut edges, soft drop shadows between layers, elegant motion, balanced composition, museum-like craft photography, realistic wall lighting, high detail, no text. Use {argument name=\"frame material\" default=\"light natural wood\"}, {argument name=\"main costume color\" default=\"sapphire blue\"}, {argument name=\"accent color\" default=\"gold\"}, {argument name=\"scene setting\" default=\"moonlit desert\"}, and {argument name=\"art style\" default=\"anime paper-cut shadow box\"}.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18231.jpg"]},{"i":10207,"text":"Create a cinematic 3D fantasy landscape at golden-hour sunrise: an enormous ornate ramen bowl sits on a circular stone temple platform high among misty Chinese mountain peaks, with warm volumetric sunlight, drifting clouds, pine trees, carved railings, lanterns, and a grand stairway leading up to the bowl. The bowl is cream ceramic with red-and-gold geometric borders and dragon illustrations, and the front has large hand-painted text reading {argument name=\"bowl label\" default=\"GPT Image 2\"}. The steaming ramen should look appetizing and detailed, with exactly 6 visible topping groups: curly noodles, 3 upright sheets of nori seaweed, a mound of chopped green onions, about 7 slices of roasted pork, 2 soft-boiled egg halves with orange yolks, and 2 pink-and-white narutomaki fish cakes. Add exactly 2 tall red vertical banners on wooden frames, one on each side of the platform, with gold lettering; the left banner reads {argument name=\"left banner text\" default=\"天下第一碗\"} and the right banner reads {argument name=\"right banner text\" default=\"美味無雙\"}. Include exactly 4 cute stone or plush guardian animals around the platform: 2 small tanuki-like figures on the left rocks, 1 round panda head near the lower right, and 1 seated bear-like figure beside the right banner. Use a wide 16:9 composition, highly polished Pixar-like / Unreal Engine realism, intricate materials, soft atmospheric haze, epic scale, sharp foreground detail, glowing rim light, and a whimsical monumental food-adventure mood.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18232.jpg"]},{"i":10208,"text":"{\"type\":\"hand-drawn illustrated cooking tutorial poster\",\"title_text\":\"{argument name=\\\"headline text\\\" default=\\\"TUTO OMELETTE\\\"}\",\"language\":\"French visible text\",\"style\":\"warm vintage cookbook illustration, cream textured paper background, navy blue ink outlines, teal numbered circles, soft watercolor shading, cozy hand-lettered typography, rounded panel borders, decorative leaves and tiny hearts\",\"layout\":{\"format\":\"square poster\",\"top\":\"large curled ribbon banner with the headline in bold dark navy uppercase letters, small botanical sprigs at both ends\",\"main_grid\":{\"position\":\"upper and middle area\",\"count\":10,\"arrangement\":\"two rows of five rounded rectangular instruction panels\",\"panels\":[{\"number\":\"1.\",\"label\":\"casser les œufs dans un bol\",\"image\":\"two cracked eggs being opened over a patterned mixing bowl, yolk dropping in\"},{\"number\":\"2.\",\"label\":\"battre les œufs au fouet\",\"image\":\"metal whisk stirring beaten eggs in the same bowl\"},{\"number\":\"3.\",\"label\":\"assaisonner avec sel et poivre\",\"image\":\"glass salt shaker and wooden pepper mill standing side by side\"},{\"number\":\"4.\",\"label\":\"faire fondre du beurre dans une poêle\",\"image\":\"small pat of butter melting and sizzling in a black frying pan with steam lines\"},{\"number\":\"5.\",\"label\":\"verser les œufs dans la poêle\",\"image\":\"beaten eggs being poured from a bowl into the frying pan\"},{\"number\":\"6.\",\"label\":\"laisser cuire à feu moyen sans remuer\",\"image\":\"flat omelette cooking in a frying pan over a small flame, steam rising\"},{\"number\":\"7.\",\"label\":\"ajouter la garniture : jambon, fromage, herbes\",\"image\":\"omelette topped with diced ham, cheese pieces, and green herbs\"},{\"number\":\"8.\",\"label\":\"plier l’omelette en deux\",\"image\":\"spatula folding the omelette into a half-moon shape\"},{\"number\":\"9.\",\"label\":\"laisser cuire encore 1 minute\",\"image\":\"folded omelette in pan with steam, small clock badge reading 1 min.\"},{\"number\":\"10.\",\"label\":\"faire glisser dans l’assiette\",\"image\":\"finished folded omelette sliding from pan onto a plate\"}]},\"bottom_left_tip_box\":{\"title\":\"ASTUCE !\",\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"tip text\\\" default=\\\"Pour une omelette encore plus moelleuse, ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de lait ou de crème aux œufs battus.\\\"}\",\"decorations\":\"dashed rounded border, little bowl, small milk pitcher with heart, blue accent marks, tiny heart\"},\"bottom_center_serving_text\":\"{argument name=\\\"serving text\\\" default=\\\"DÉGUSTER CHAUD, NATURE OU AVEC UNE SALADE !\\\"}\",\"bottom_right_hero\":\"large plated golden folded omelette sprinkled with green herbs on a white oval plate with blue scalloped rim, wooden-handled fork on the right, small parsley sprigs and floral doodles around it\"},\"ingredients_and_objects\":{\"count\":8,\"items\":[\"eggs\",\"mixing bowl\",\"whisk\",\"salt shaker\",\"pepper mill\",\"butter\",\"black frying pan\",\"spatula\"],\"customizable_filling\":\"{argument name=\\\"omelette filling\\\" default=\\\"ham, cheese, herbs\\\"}\"},\"composition_notes\":\"Ensure every step number from 1 to 10 is clear and correctly ordered, with French hand-lettered captions below each mini illustration. Keep the poster charming, clean, symmetrical, and readable, like a vintage illustrated recipe card.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18233.jpg"]},{"i":10209,"text":"Create a clean, realistic desktop browser screenshot of the {argument name=\"country version\" default=\"Japanese\"} Google homepage in a Chrome-like window, viewed straight on at 4:3 aspect ratio. The browser UI shows one active tab labeled Google with the Google favicon, a plus button for a new tab, back and forward arrows, reload, a lock icon, and the address bar containing {argument name=\"website URL\" default=\"google.co.jp\"}; at the far right are a star bookmark icon, three-dot menu, and window controls. The webpage is mostly white with the multicolor Google logo centered high on the page. In the top-right of the page are exactly 4 items: the text link “Gmail”, the text link “画像”, a 3-by-3 Google apps grid icon, and a circular user profile avatar showing a small blue mountain landscape. Centered beneath the logo is one rounded search bar with a magnifying glass icon on the left, placeholder text {argument name=\"search placeholder\" default=\"Google で検索または URL を入力\"}, and exactly 2 icons on the right: a microphone and Google Lens. Below it are exactly 2 light-gray buttons labeled {argument name=\"first button text\" default=\"Google 検索\"} and {argument name=\"second button text\" default=\"I'm Feeling Lucky\"}. Under the buttons is a small language line reading “Google.com in English,” with “English” in blue. At the bottom is a pale gray footer with the location “日本” on the first row and exactly 6 footer links on the second row: “広告”, “ビジネス”, “検索の仕組み”, “プライバシー”, “規約”, and “設定”. Use accurate Google colors, crisp sans-serif typography, subtle shadows, soft gray browser chrome, lots of empty white space, and photorealistic UI rendering.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18234.jpg"]},{"i":10210,"text":"Create a full-body anime-style character illustration on a plain white background, showing a tall, slim young Black man with dark brown skin standing in a relaxed streetwear pose, head slightly tilted, shoulders loose, and both hands tucked into his pants pockets. His face is intentionally obscured by a centered square blur/censor block with a soft brown-to-white gradient, while short high-top black hair and one visible ear remain partly visible. He wears an oversized {argument name=\"sweatshirt color\" default=\"warm brown\"} crewneck sweatshirt with loose sleeves and wrinkled fabric, layered over a slightly visible off-white undershirt at the hem. Around his neck are two thin gold chains, one with a small {argument name=\"pendant shape\" default=\"Africa-shaped pendant\"}. He wears baggy {argument name=\"pants color\" default=\"deep purple\"} track pants with a single bold white side stripe on each leg, gathered at the ankles, plus cream and purple high-top sneakers with dark laces and chunky soles. Use clean manga/anime line art, muted colors, subtle cel shading, expressive clothing folds, long proportions, and a fashion character design feel, with the figure centered vertically and no props or background details.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18235.jpg"]},{"i":10211,"text":"Create a cinematic, hyper-realistic portrait of a {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"powerful indigenous tribal warrior\"} crouching on a grassy mountain ridge, facing the camera in a low, dominant pose. The subject has dark weathered skin with white ritual body-paint markings across the arms, chest, shoulders, and legs, and wears a dramatic feather headdress made of many tall dark green, brown, and gray feathers radiating upward. The face is deliberately hidden by a centered, flat dark-brown square censor block. The warrior holds one long wooden spear vertically in the left hand, with a dark stone spearhead wrapped in rough cord. Clothing and accessories are primitive and handmade: layered fur and bark-fiber cloak over the shoulders, rope armbands and wrist wraps, a rough woven loincloth, dangling cords, and a necklace of carved bones, teeth, and beads. The figure is muscular, grounded, and tense, with one hand planted on the mossy earth in the foreground. Set the scene against distant misty green mountains under a dramatic {argument name=\"sky mood\" default=\"stormy gray overcast sky\"}. Use moody natural light, high contrast, desaturated earthy colors, sharp texture detail on skin, feathers, rope, fur, mud, grass, and stone, shallow depth of field, epic documentary photography style, vertical portrait composition, realistic 85mm lens look, no text.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18236.jpg"]},{"i":10212,"text":"Using the provided reference image, create a clean professional studio headshot portrait of the same person while preserving their face identity, blue hair, black shirt, ear plug, neck tattoo, silver chain, and ankh pendant. Reframe to a centered chest-up composition with the subject facing forward, replace the room/gaming-chair/bookshelf background with a softly lit neutral gray-blue studio backdrop, improve lighting and sharpness, and make the image look like a polished profile photo. Keep the large square privacy blur over the face in the same style, centered over the facial features.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18237.jpg"]},{"i":10213,"text":"Create a cinematic fantasy image of a radiant {argument name=\"angel gender\" default=\"androgynous male\"} angel descending through a sea of glowing clouds at sunrise, centered in a wide panoramic composition. The angel has an idealized athletic body, long flowing {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"golden blond\"} hair blowing in the light, a softly obscured or faceless face overwhelmed by divine radiance, bare chest, bare feet, and a wind-tossed white linen wrap draped around the waist and across one shoulder with long translucent fabric ribbons trailing downward. Show exactly two enormous feathered wings, one extending left and one extending right, spanning almost the full width of the frame; the feathers are layered, detailed, ivory and gold, backlit so their edges glow. The angel floats with legs together, arms open outward in a welcoming blessing pose, palms relaxed. Behind the head is an intense sunburst halo of {argument name=\"divine light color\" default=\"warm golden white\"} light, with dramatic volumetric rays streaming through towering cumulus clouds. The atmosphere is heavenly, serene, awe-inspiring and majestic, filled with tiny sparkling dust motes, soft lens flare, radiant mist, and high-contrast golden illumination. Use hyperrealistic digital painting / epic concept art style, ultra-detailed feathers, luminous skin, ethereal fabric motion, symmetrical composition, wide 21:9 aspect ratio, no text, no border, no modern objects.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18238.jpg"]},{"i":10214,"text":"Using the provided reference image as the character source, extract the small green graffiti creature and reimagine it as a clean black-outlined sprite in a colorful retro 2D pixel-art side-scrolling platform game. Do not keep the brick alley background; replace it with a bright fantasy ruin level: blue sky with puffy clouds, lush jungle plants, mossy stone platforms, and a large ancient temple with columns in the background. Place the referenced green creature on the left platform facing right. Add exactly 4 new interactive game elements: 1 flying knife projectile traveling rightward, 1 glass jar containing a pink brain being struck with a starburst impact, 1 red crab-like enemy with X eyes and raised claws, and 1 green crocodile-like enemy on the far right with a red “70” damage number beside it. Make the whole scene look like a polished 16-bit platformer screenshot with crisp pixel edges, saturated colors, parallax depth, and no photorealistic elements.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18239.jpg"]},{"i":10215,"text":"{\"type\":\"photorealistic fashion editorial contact sheet\",\"format\":\"3 by 3 grid collage with thin white gutters, square overall image\",\"subject\":{\"identity\":\"same glamorous young East Asian woman in every panel\",\"age\":\"mid 20s\",\"face\":\"delicate oval face, fair skin, soft glam makeup, defined eyeliner, rosy lips, poised slightly wistful expression\",\"hair\":\"{argument name=\\\"hair color and style\\\" default=\\\"long voluminous dark brown wavy hair swept to one side\\\"}\",\"pose_style\":\"elegant fashion poses, hands holding or parting curtains, seated or standing near a bed, direct eye contact with camera\"},\"setting\":{\"location\":\"luxury high-rise hotel bedroom at night\",\"background\":\"floor-to-ceiling windows with blurred city lights, warm bedside lamps, plush bed, cream and dark drapes\",\"lighting\":\"warm cinematic indoor lighting mixed with cool city bokeh, glossy editorial highlights, shallow depth of field\"},\"layout\":{\"panel_count\":9,\"panels\":[{\"position\":\"top left\",\"outfit\":\"{argument name=\\\"outfit 1\\\" default=\\\"tailored beige pantsuit with deep V blazer and matching trousers\\\"}\",\"curtains\":\"champagne sheer curtains\",\"pose\":\"standing and holding one curtain open beside the window\"},{\"position\":\"top center\",\"outfit\":\"{argument name=\\\"outfit 2\\\" default=\\\"white satin blouse tucked into a black mini skirt with sheer black tights\\\"}\",\"curtains\":\"cream curtains\",\"pose\":\"leaning forward between parted curtains, hands gripping both sides\"},{\"position\":\"top right\",\"outfit\":\"{argument name=\\\"outfit 3\\\" default=\\\"off-shoulder black velvet evening dress\\\"}\",\"curtains\":\"deep red velvet curtains\",\"pose\":\"standing in profile three-quarter view, one hand on the curtain\"},{\"position\":\"middle left\",\"outfit\":\"red satin slip mini dress with thin straps\",\"curtains\":\"cream curtains\",\"pose\":\"seated near the bed, holding curtains apart with both hands\"},{\"position\":\"middle center\",\"outfit\":\"champagne satin slip mini dress with thin straps\",\"curtains\":\"cream curtains\",\"pose\":\"seated on bed edge, one hand braced on mattress, alluring editorial posture\"},{\"position\":\"middle right\",\"outfit\":\"ivory satin slip mini dress with thin straps\",\"curtains\":\"cream curtains\",\"pose\":\"seated on bed, hands resting outward near curtains\"},{\"position\":\"bottom left\",\"outfit\":\"lavender glitter two-piece evening set, crop top and fitted skirt with sheer sparkling shawl\",\"curtains\":\"pale lavender sheer curtains\",\"pose\":\"standing at the curtain opening, soft tilted head\"},{\"position\":\"bottom center\",\"outfit\":\"blue denim bustier crop top, high-waisted jeans, and cropped denim jacket\",\"curtains\":\"brown drapes\",\"pose\":\"standing confidently while holding both curtain panels\"},{\"position\":\"bottom right\",\"outfit\":\"dramatic strapless black tulle cocktail dress with plunging lace bodice and layered ruffle skirt\",\"curtains\":\"black curtains\",\"pose\":\"standing with arms extended, holding curtains wide open\"}]},\"camera_and_style\":{\"camera\":\"professional full-frame fashion photography, 50mm lens look, medium shots and three-quarter portraits\",\"rendering\":\"ultra realistic, high detail skin texture, polished magazine editorial retouching, crisp fabric sheen, cinematic hotel ambience\",\"mood\":\"luxurious, sensual, elegant, nighttime glamour\"},\"negative_prompt\":\"no text, no logos, no watermark, no extra people, no distorted hands, no duplicated faces within a panel, no cartoon or illustration style\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18240.jpg"]},{"i":10216,"text":"{\"type\":\"desktop browser screenshot of a minimalist personal portfolio website homepage design draft\",\"style\":\"Swiss grid system, brutalist minimalism, black and white palette, faint technical blueprint guides, thin gray borders, lots of whitespace, monospace micro-labels mixed with bold geometric sans-serif display type\",\"canvas\":{\"aspect_ratio\":\"wide 16:9\",\"environment\":\"shown inside a Chrome-like browser window at localhost:5173 with visible tabs, bookmarks bar, and address bar\",\"background\":\"white\"},\"brand\":{\"logo\":\"small square outlined mark with initials NRS\",\"name\":\"{argument name=\\\"character name\\\" default=\\\"Naufaldi Rafif S.\\\"}\"},\"header\":{\"position\":\"top fixed website navbar below browser chrome\",\"height\":\"about 64px\",\"left_brand\":\"NRS logo followed by Naufaldi Rafif S.\",\"navigation\":{\"count\":6,\"items\":[\"HOME\",\"BLOG\",\"PROJECTS\",\"ABOUT\",\"SPEAKER\",\"OTHER with down chevron\"],\"active_item\":\"HOME in a thin outlined rectangular tab\"},\"actions\":{\"count\":3,\"items\":[\"Contact white outlined button\",\"Download CV black filled button with arrow\",\"small square sun/theme icon button\"]}},\"layout\":{\"main_container\":\"large centered rectangular grid area with faint vertical and horizontal guide lines, coordinate labels, and thin border\",\"technical_annotations\":{\"count\":7,\"labels\":[\"X-1440\",\"X-768\",\"X-0\",\"X-1024\",\"X-768\",\"X-480\",\"Y-0 / Y-360 / Y-720 guide markings\"]},\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"01 // INTRO\",\"position\":\"left large content column\",\"count\":1,\"content\":\"huge boxed headline reading {argument name=\\\"headline text\\\" default=\\\"NAUFALDI RAFIF S.\\\"} split across two lines, black all-caps extra-bold type\"},{\"title\":\"professional summary\",\"position\":\"below headline in left column\",\"count\":3,\"items\":[\"subtitle: {argument name=\\\"role title\\\" default=\\\"Software Engineer & Mentor\\\"}\",\"specialty tags: PRODUCT SYSTEMS | BACKEND FOUNDATIONS | ENGINEERING MENTORSHIP\",\"paragraph: {argument name=\\\"bio paragraph\\\" default=\\\"My foundation is frontend, but the direction is broader: backend ownership, product architecture, and end-to-end software delivery.\\\"}\"]},{\"title\":\"02 // ROUTES\",\"position\":\"right sidebar separated by a vertical divider\",\"count\":3,\"items\":[\"01 View projects, black active card with code icon and right arrow\",\"02 Get in touch, white row with right arrow\",\"03 Download CV, white row with right arrow\"]},{\"title\":\"bottom status strip\",\"position\":\"bottom of bordered container\",\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"OPEN TO WORK\",\"7 YRS EXPERIENCE\",\"1000+ MENTEES\",\"BEKASI, INDONESIA\"]}],\"footer_meta\":\"right side of bottom strip shows BUILD:2026 and PRD:01\"},\"typography\":{\"headline\":\"massive uppercase bold sans-serif, tight spacing\",\"body\":\"clean readable sans-serif\",\"microcopy\":\"small uppercase monospace with wide letter spacing\"},\"color_palette\":{\"primary\":\"#0b0d0e near-black\",\"background\":\"#ffffff\",\"border\":\"#e8e8e8 light gray\",\"guides\":\"#edf2ef very faint green-gray\",\"accent\":\"thin green line on active route card and top grid guide\"},\"composition_notes\":\"Make it look like a polished web design system mockup generated for implementation, not a marketing landing page; emphasize precise alignment, grid overlays, coordinate labels, and modern developer portfolio aesthetics.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18242.jpg"]},{"i":10217,"text":"Create a realistic shallow-depth-of-field street photo of a hand holding a clear plastic cup of iced layered drink in front of a small outdoor beverage stall. The main drink is a tall transparent cup with a domed flat lid, filled with three distinct layers: deep red berry syrup at the bottom, creamy white milk with red streaks in the middle, and chunky bright green matcha on top; the cup is held by a left hand in a muted gray-green sleeve. Keep the background softly blurred: an outdoor counter with syrup bottles on the right, a white cloth banner reading large playful black text \"Eh!\" and \"Chocolat\", plus small menu words \"Chocolate\", \"Maring\", and \"Refreshing\", a pink menu board behind it, and a white illustrated drink menu board on the left. Add playful hand-drawn doodles directly interacting with the drink and scene, as if drawn over the photo: one smiling strawberry character riding a red-and-white candy-striped ribbon swirl around the cup, one smiling green leaf character riding a small red-and-white rocket launching from the cup toward the upper right, three visible candy-striped ribbon arcs wrapping around or streaming from the drink, one dotted multicolor path curling down the left side of the hand, one small handwritten \"Phew!\" with three blue sweat drops near the thumb, one arch of small cookie or chocolate-chip doodles above the lid with a tiny square chocolate character at the top, four yellow star doodles around the banner, and three small doodled drink icons on the banner matching the labels: a brown chocolate drink, a yellow maring drink, and a green refreshing drink. Use cheerful black marker outlines, red, green, yellow, and blue accent colors, whimsical motion lines, and integrate the doodles so they mimic the drink's flowing layers and energetic fresh flavor. The scene should feel like a candid food-and-drink social media photo enhanced with cute animated doodles, preserving natural lighting, realistic hand anatomy, and the original composition centered on the cup. Customize the drink flavor as {argument name=\"drink flavor\" default=\"strawberry matcha milk\"}, the main banner text as {argument name=\"banner text\" default=\"Eh! Chocolat\"}, the handwritten exclamation as {argument name=\"exclamation text\" default=\"Phew!\"}, the doodle mascot pair as {argument name=\"doodle mascots\" default=\"smiling strawberry and green leaf\"}, and the stall setting as {argument name=\"stall setting\" default=\"outdoor beverage stall\"}.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18243.jpg"]},{"i":10218,"text":"Create an ultra-realistic cinematic night street scene in {argument name=\"city\" default=\"Tokyo\"}, showing a narrow rainy alley lined with ramen shops and dense vertical neon signs. The camera is at street level with a wide-angle documentary feel, looking down the wet pavement where blue, red, and white neon reflections stretch across puddles. In the right foreground, an open-air ramen counter glows with warm amber light and heavy steam; a chef in a dark work shirt with tattooed forearms lifts noodles from a boiling pot with chopsticks, his face obscured by a soft rectangular anonymizing blur. Hang exactly two prominent red paper lanterns over the stall, both with bold black Japanese text {argument name=\"lantern text\" default=\"ラーメン\"}. Add stainless pots, stacked bowls, chopsticks, condiment bottles, hanging lamps, dark noren curtains, and a tall black wooden signboard with large gold Japanese calligraphy beside the counter. The background alley should contain distant silhouettes of pedestrians, countless small illuminated storefront signs, rain streaks, mist, and atmospheric steam drifting through the scene. Style: photorealistic but clearly AI-generated, high dynamic range, moody cyberpunk-noir color palette, wet asphalt, volumetric lighting, sharp foreground detail, deep perspective, 16:9 composition, dramatic contrast, shot as if with a 24mm lens at night after rainfall.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18244.jpg"]},{"i":10219,"text":"Create a vertical high-fashion editorial photograph of {argument name=\"character\" default=\"a graceful Cinderella-inspired blonde woman\"} seated on an ornate gilded bench in an opulent palace interior, leaning forward while delicately adjusting a transparent crystal glass slipper on her extended foot. Her face is fully covered by a flat beige rectangular anonymizing block, while her posture remains elegant and poised. She wears {argument name=\"dress color\" default=\"pale sky blue\"} off-the-shoulder tulle and lace ball gown with sheer draped sleeves, a fitted lace bodice, a plunging neckline, and voluminous translucent layers pooling around the bench, exposing her bare legs. Her hair is styled in a sculptural blonde updo with soft curled tendrils, tied with a bright azure satin ribbon trailing behind her head. The glass slipper is clear and glossy with a slim heel and sparkling crystal embellishment at the toe. Set the scene in a refined classical chamber with a large ornate gilded mirror on the left, an antique gold console table beneath it, cream marble walls, and a softly blurred sweeping staircase in the background on the right. Use soft cinematic side lighting from the left, shallow depth of field, warm highlights, cool blue fairy-tale atmosphere, luxurious fabric texture, realistic skin, elegant composition, centered subject, 9:16 vertical crop, editorial fashion photography style.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18245.jpg"]},{"i":10220,"text":"竖版高清肖像，写实编辑摄影风格，主角为一位 {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"年轻韩系偶像\"}，散发着优雅、成熟的“冷艳”气质，五官精致，蓬松的黑色短发带有柔和的碎发，妆容搭配精致红唇。她以放松、优雅的姿态盘腿坐在黑色皮质沙发上，单手持鞭。姿态舒展、从容且充满自信，展现出健康、优雅的身材线条。服装：{argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"廓形黑色剪裁西装外套，搭配白色衬衫和黑色领带\"}，下身穿着黑色短裙。造型高级、职场风且前卫，具有强烈的“霸道女总裁”美感。简约的戒指配饰增添了一抹细腻的质感。场景：现代极简室内肖像环境，配有黑色皮质沙发、墙面艺术画框以及悬挂在墙上的西装。背景干净、高端、极简，呈现出时尚杂志拍摄现场的质感。光影与氛围：深色电影感光效，侧逆光勾勒出人物轮廓，明暗对比强烈，冷色调氛围，丰富的复古胶片质感，情绪感十足且极具沉浸感。皮肤纹理细腻通透，发丝清晰分明，衣物面料、短裙以及复古相机的质感渲染得真实细腻。风格：高端成熟职场时尚杂志肖像，写实人像，8K 超高清细节，顶级视觉质量，细节极其丰富，自然真实，无 AI 畸变，审美高级，品味出众，完全符合平台安全规范。在右下角添加一行白色手写签名文字 “{argument name=\"signature\" default=\"BubbleBrain\"}”","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18298.jpg"]},{"i":10221,"text":"一张充满活力的夏季生活方式摄影作品，画面中一位 {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"时尚年轻女性\"} 手持一罐印有“{argument name=\"brand name\" default=\"LIMELIFT – Sparkling Citrus Fizz Lemon Lime\"}”字样的细长饮料罐。她身穿 {argument name=\"clothing\" default=\"浅绿色西装外套、白色露脐上衣和牛仔裤\"}，佩戴着绿色太阳镜和配套耳环。她梳着凌乱的丸子头，侧身微笑，背景是一面投射着热带棕榈叶阴影的绿松石色墙壁。明亮的自然光，锐利的阴影，清新的柑橘色调，超写实，高细节，商业广告风格，85mm 镜头，浅景深。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18300.jpg"]},{"i":10222,"text":"超写实 4K 商业产品摄影，拍摄一个名为“{argument name=\"beverage name\" default=\"KESAR BADAM\"}”的高级饮品罐，居中且略微倾斜，表面覆盖着冷凝水珠。罐身采用 {argument name=\"label style\" default=\"奶油米色和天蓝色标签设计\"}，搭配醒目且活泼的排版。罐身中央的圆形徽标内有一位时尚年轻男性的肖像，他站立着并将 Kesar Badam 捧在手中朝向镜头，作为品牌标识。罐身周围环绕着浓郁奶油牛奶和红色藏红花与金色藏红花液混合的动态飞溅，形成极具张力的流体形状。漂浮的配料包括 {argument name=\"ingredients\" default=\"整粒坚果和杏仁、杏仁片、腰果、藏红花丝\"}，以及悬浮在半空中的金色液滴和冰块。背景为暗绿色，带有暖黄色高光，营造出浓郁的电影感对比。摄影棚灯光配合强烈的轮廓光和光泽反射，增强了罐身的金属质感。景深较浅，使罐身保持清晰，飞溅部分略微模糊以增加真实感。高度细腻的纹理，超写实的流体物理效果，高级广告风格，焦点清晰，高对比度，鲜艳的暖色调，专业的食品和饮品产品拍摄。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18301.jpg"]},{"i":10223,"text":"超写实电影感特写人像，主体为 {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"头发湿润且留着胡须的坚毅男子\"}，佩戴 {argument name=\"accessories\" default=\"圆框眼镜\"}，{argument name=\"eye color\" default=\"深邃的蓝色眼眸\"} 聚焦清晰，戏剧性情绪光影，冷色调处理，头发和毛皮大衣上带有雪花与冰晶，极致的皮肤纹理细节，毛孔与皱纹清晰可见，浅景深，85mm 镜头质感，柔和的背景虚化，冬季氛围，深青色与灰色调，高对比度，电影剧照风格，杰作，8K，超高细节，电影级构图。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18302.jpg"]},{"i":10224,"text":"阿芙佳朵 (Affogato) 美食特写摄影：热浓缩咖啡正缓缓倒入玻璃杯中的香草冰淇淋球上，捕捉浓郁咖啡流注入的瞬间，背景为温暖的木质桌面，采用暖色调的舒适灯光，浅景深效果，呈现奶油质感与光泽反射。添加俏皮的手绘涂鸦（爱心、闪光、箭头）和可爱的手写字体：“COMFORT IN A CUP”。在周围加入小巧的审美短语，如“calm”、“happy”、“me time”、“one spoon at a time”。高细节美食造型，电影级灯光，柔和阴影，Instagram 风格的温馨甜点广告，超写实，4K 分辨率。俯拍 / 侧角特写：陶瓷盘上一块带有水果夹心的松软奶油蛋糕，旁边放着叉子，背景为温暖的木质桌面，营造舒适的咖啡馆氛围，柔和的自然光，浅景深效果。添加可爱的手绘涂鸦和俏皮的手写字体：“SWEET LITTLE BREAK”。加入审美文本元素，如“you deserve it”、“happy”、“calm”、“slice of happiness”、“small treat, big mood”。暖色调分级，柔和高光，细腻的蛋糕纹理，生活方式甜点摄影，Instagram 风格构图，超写实，4K 分辨率。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18303.jpg"]},{"i":10225,"text":"超写实 {argument name=\"shoe model\" default=\"Nike Dunk Low Syracuse\"} 广告，电影级 3:4 海报。一位年轻男模特（与参考图脸部一致）被捕捉到在空中呈现动态漂浮姿态，身穿 {argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"宽松棕色大码 T 恤，工装裤\"}，脚穿 Nike Dunk Low Syracuse 橙白配色运动鞋。鞋子清晰可见且细节丰富，一只脚略微向前。背景为深黑色，周围环绕着明亮的橙色粉末爆炸、碎片和漂浮颗粒，营造出动感和冲击力。顶部和侧面采用戏剧性的摄影棚灯光，脸部和衣物上有强烈的亮光，阴影对比鲜明。构图包括顶部的大号粗体排版：“DUNK LOW”，下方为橙色的“SYRACUSE”。Nike 标志置于上方。添加微妙的品牌元素和标语，如“BE TRUE TO YOUR SCHOOL”。超清晰对焦，细腻的织物纹理，鞋子呈现逼真的皮革材质，电影级调色，高端商业摄影风格，充满动态能量、深度和运动感。清晰的叠加效果，高级广告美学。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18305.jpg"]},{"i":10226,"text":"在保持所有元素可辨识的前提下，通过微妙地夸张比例来增强天真烂漫的童趣感，并保持柔和、友好且愉悦的表情。保留原始图像的核心构图与可识别元素，但以 {argument name=\"art style\" default=\"简约、卡通化的蜡笔风格\"} 对其进行重新诠释。最终效果应显得可爱、色彩丰富、俏皮、天真且充满童真个性，呈现出温暖、不完美的手绘外观，就像真实的儿童蜡笔画跃然纸上。应避免任何精致的数字绘画感，并严格保持清晰可见的蜡笔质感以及整体自然的瑕疵感。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18306.jpg"]},{"i":10227,"text":"创建一个 {argument name=\"streaming service\" default=\"Netflix\"} 首页 UI，其中包含一个主打电影，其标题和海报均根据上传的参考图生成。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18307.jpg"]},{"i":10228,"text":"[电影剧照], [高角度], [{argument name=\"main subject\" default=\"充当飞机的超现实巨鸟\"}], [穿着商务休闲装和旅行装、背着背包的微型人类乘客], [通过移动式机场登机梯登上巨鸟], [背景是带有航站楼的机场停机坪], [柔和的复古色调，带有去饱和的中性色], [阴天的自然光，氛围既异想天开又平凡], [轻微的胶片颗粒感和深景深], [{argument name=\"camera settings\" default=\"Kodak Portra 400 + 35mm 广角镜头\"}]","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18308.jpg"]},{"i":10229,"text":"创建一个竖版格式的儿童绘本内页，采用温暖的米白色纸张背景和多格故事书排版。使用 {argument name=\"art style\" default=\"带有柔和水粉、彩色铅笔和蜡笔质感的儿童手绘插画风格\"}，呈现可见的纸张纹理、自然的素描线条以及圆润可爱的角色。添加清晰易读的故事文本，排版布局如同真实的绘本页面。关键词可以用颜色高亮显示，页面中点缀少量手绘装饰元素。{argument name=\"subject\" default=\"OpenAI 的故事，多页面\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18309.jpg"]},{"i":10230,"text":"使用上传的图像，在不改变面部的前提下，创作一幅超写实的全身艺术构图，塑造一个完全由 {argument name=\"material\" default=\"交织的枯枝和细枝\"} 组成的女性形象，通过自然的流动感和精准度雕刻出她的身体结构，木材纹理无缝勾勒出她的曲线、四肢和面部特征；通过裂纹、节疤和微妙的色彩变化等精细细节增强树枝的质感，以提升真实感；让她的头发如随风飘动的细枝般向外延伸，增添动感与优雅；背景设置为简洁、极简的浅色背景以强调对比度和形态，采用柔和的漫射光，投射出轻柔的阴影以突显深度和结构；保持一种精致、雕塑感且富有自然灵感的审美，呈现高清晰度以及平衡的画廊级质感。 {argument name=\"aspect ratio\" default=\"比例 9:16\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18310.jpg"]},{"i":10231,"text":"未来大都市夜间屋顶的超写实电影感对决。一位身着街头风格服饰的模特，穿着 {argument name=\"clothing\" default=\"带有精致羽毛天使翅膀的超大款白色连帽衫\"}，站在一侧，散发着柔和的神圣轮廓光，展现出冷静而强大的气场。对面是 {argument name=\"opponent\" default=\"风格化卡通恶魔兔子，体型虽小但充满威胁感\"}，身穿 {argument name=\"opponent outfit\" default=\"红色皮夹克\"}，头顶发光的红色犄角，双眼闪烁着霓虹光芒，散发出混乱的能量。\n\n他们身后是广阔的赛博朋克城市天际线，布满了全息广告牌和发光的窗户。头顶上方，一场风暴将天空一分为二：一半被柔和的天界光芒和漂浮的云层照亮，另一半则被黑暗的雷云吞噬，电光闪烁的红色闪电撕裂了大气层。\n\n戏剧性的对比光影，超精细纹理，浅景深，电影级构图，8K 写实画质，超现实奇幻基调，紧张的对峙构图，服装与翅膀的动态风感，充满张力与象征意义的氛围。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18312.jpg"]},{"i":10232,"text":"编辑图像，同时保持原始照片完全不变，包括人物、面部、身体、姿势、光影和健身房背景。在图像周围添加多个可爱的 {argument name=\"sticker style\" default=\"Q 版“迷你形象”\"}。每个迷你角色都应拥有大头、生动的面部特征，并与她本人的发型和服装相匹配。描绘每个迷你版本正在进行不同的 {argument name=\"activity theme\" default=\"健身相关活动\"}：一个举起双臂欢呼，一个穿着跑鞋奔跑，一个拿着摇摇杯喝水，一个戴着运动跑步眼镜，一个在她腿边攀爬。用 {argument name=\"accent colors\" default=\"白色和粉色墨水\"} 的俏皮手绘涂鸦和手写笔记来增强图像，营造剪贴簿风格。包含箭头、星星、爱心、闪光和简笔线条等元素。添加可爱的健身主题手写励志短语：“lift strong”、“stronger every rep”、“no pain no gain”、“sweat now, shine later”、“progress over perfection”、“train hard, stay soft”。整体氛围应充满趣味、活力和女性气息。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18313.jpg"]},{"i":10233,"text":"基于上传的真实照片，创作一张高质量的“{argument name=\"style\" default=\"Q 版克隆贴纸日记照片\"}”。请保留原人物的身份、面部特征、发型、发色、服装、身体比例、姿势、光影和背景。请勿改变面部特征或将主体完全转化为插画——需保持写实照片的质感。\n将场景分析为 {argument name=\"activity\" default=\"健身/跑步\"} 的生活方式瞬间。在主体周围添加 5–8 个同人物的 Q 版迷你克隆体，采用统一的可爱贴纸风格设计（大头、小身体、大而有神的眼睛、干净的数字绘画质感）。每个克隆体必须清晰地还原真实人物特征（相同的发型、服装和配色）。\n为每个 Q 版角色设计不同的 {argument name=\"action theme\" default=\"跑步相关动作\"} 和情绪：慢跑、拉伸、喝水、疲惫、欢呼、竖大拇指、庆祝完成。确保所有姿势独特且符合语境。\n将每个 Q 版角色渲染为带有白色描边、柔和阴影和轻微浮动效果的贴纸。将它们排列在主体周围及边缘，但不要遮挡面部或主体身体。\n添加轻盈的手绘涂鸦（爱心、闪光、箭头、运动线条、圆圈），颜色以白色为主，辅以微妙的粉色点缀，保持干净的剪贴簿日记感。\n包含 5–8 个符合健身氛围（可爱、充满活力、鼓励性）的简短手写风格短语。主要使用白色文字，带有轻微的粉色高光和小装饰符号。\n构图：保持真实人物为中心焦点，周围环绕 Q 版贴纸和涂鸦。最终效果应呈现为一张精致、有趣、高分辨率的社交媒体生活方式日记图片——画面干净、平衡且视觉丰富，不显杂乱。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18314.jpg"]},{"i":10234,"text":"一张电影级的高级时尚肖像，主角是一位自信且时尚的女性，身着优雅剪裁的 {argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"白色西装\"}，采用高领设计，并佩戴着精致的 {argument name=\"accessory\" default=\"椭圆形太阳镜\"}。她手中拿着一支细长的中号雪茄，烟雾缭绕，旁边是一张微微燃烧的 {argument name=\"prop\" default=\"红桃 K 扑克牌\"}，带有细微的火焰细节。缕缕轻烟向上飘散。背景是鲜明、充满活力的纯红色无缝背景布。高调专业摄影棚灯光，带有柔和的阴影，温和的暖色高光映照在她的脸上。超逼真的皮肤纹理，面部特征聚焦清晰，浅景深，柔和的背景虚化，35mm 镜头质感。对比鲜明，现代时尚编辑摄影风格，简洁的奢华美学，格调精致、有力且略带叛逆。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18315.jpg"]},{"i":10235,"text":"{\n\"style\": \"{argument name=\"art style\" default=\"半写实 3D 波普艺术漫画插画\"}\",\n\n\"subject\": {\n\"identity\": \"{argument name=\"identity\" default=\"严格保持参考图像的面部特征，结构、比例或相似度均无变化\"}\",\n\"appearance\": \"光滑透亮的皮肤、富有表现力的眼睛、自然的嘴唇、轮廓分明的眉毛、完全保留整洁的发型\",\n\"expression\": \"冷静、自信，与参考图一致\",\n\"pose\": \"自然放松的站姿\"\n},\n\n\"outfit\": {\n\"top\": \"{argument name=\"clothing\" default=\"带有精致徽标的时尚休闲毛衣或 Polo 衫\"}\",\n\"bottom\": \"修身长裤\",\n\"style\": \"简洁、现代、极简\"\n},\n\n\"composition\": {\n\"framing\": \"主体居中，占据画面的约 60%\",\n\"perspective\": \"略有角度但主要为正面\"\n},\n\n\"background\": {\n\"type\": \"结构化的 6 格漫画网格\",\n\"depth\": \"微妙的分层深度感\"\n},\n\n\"panels\": [\n\"左上：自然地整理头发（抓拍动态）\",\n\"右上：清晰的侧面轮廓视图\",\n\"中间两格：柔和的半色调纹理\",\n\"左下：转身看向镜头\",\n\"右下：带有粗体“ZAP”字样的抽象漫画爆发效果\"\n],\n\n\"environment\": \"带有柔和涂鸦纹理的城市街道，轻微模糊\",\n\n\"style_details\": {\n\"primary\": \"高细节半写实 3D 渲染\",\n\"secondary\": \"波普艺术漫画叠加\",\n\"linework\": \"粗黑轮廓线\",\n\"shading\": \"柔和的赛璐珞阴影\",\n\"color\": \"受控的鲜艳色调，色彩平衡温暖\"\n},\n\n\"lighting\": \"温暖的电影级柔光，带有清晰的高光\",\n\n\"camera\": {\n\"lens\": \"50mm 人像镜头\",\n\"depth_of_field\": \"浅景深\"\n},\n\n\"quality\": \"超精细、平滑渲染、4K\",\n\n\"aspect_ratio\": \"4:5\",\n\n\"output_goal\": \"完美的脸部一致性与时尚的漫画叙事布局\"\n}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18316.jpg"]},{"i":10236,"text":"微距摄影作品，主体为 {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"隐藏在人类发丝间的微缩城市\"}，清晰地置于真实的人类头部，可见部分前额与发际线，逼真的皮肤纹理及毛孔，微小的人群在发丝间的街道上行走，比例极小但真实，微距摄影，{argument name=\"lens\" default=\"85mm 镜头\"}，浅景深，自然光，中性色调，无暖色调，超逼真的发丝，可见发根，自然的瑕疵，略显凌乱的发丝，逼真的材质，略带污垢的建筑，无完美表面，照片级真实，看起来像真实照片，非插画，非 CGI，无发光效果","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18317.jpg"]},{"i":10237,"text":"将 {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"[在此输入]\"} 转化为柔和的大气云雾构图，同时保留主体可辨认的面部特征、表情和身份。\n面部应呈现出由云雾微妙构成的形态，自然地融入明亮的蓝天背景中。使用柔和的漫射光，配合轻柔的高光和空灵的阴影，以营造深度感与真实感。\n确保这种变换是象征性的而非字面意义上的——避免生硬的边缘、皮肤纹理或锐利的细节。主体应呈现出从云层中浮现或消融其中的感觉。\n保持面部比例、眼睛、微笑以及关键特征在云雾结构中清晰可见。\n风格：梦幻、空灵、超现实、电影感\n光影：自然日光、柔和光晕、体积光\n色调：天蓝、纯白、柔和渐变\n氛围：宁静、振奋、启发性\n在面部周围及内部添加微妙的云层，实现无缝融合。背景应为纯净的蓝天，并带有柔和的云雾渐变。\n高分辨率，超写实云雾纹理，平滑融合，无文字，无水印。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18320.jpg"]},{"i":10238,"text":"创建一个 2x3 网格（6 个分镜）的电影感项目页面，单张图像，{argument name=\"style\" default=\"3D 皮克斯风格\"}，柔和的暖色调灯光，基于 {argument name=\"theme\" default=\"Gugu Gaga 玩偶服宇宙\"}。此页面为“分享你的光芒 – 第一部分”，应呈现出 15 秒短片所需的完整感。所有分镜中的角色需保持一致：\n\n- Gugu Gaga 企鹅：身穿黑色企鹅吉祥物玩偶服的娇小可爱儿童，白色肚皮，黄色脚掌，黄色喙状兜帽，短而凌乱的深色头发，蓝色发夹，带有项圈和斜挎带。\n\n- Sunny 小鸡：身穿圆形黄色小鸡玩偶服的娇小可爱儿童，带有小巧的橙色喙，短卷橙色头发，向日葵发夹。\n\n包含简单的对话气泡，并附上引号内的准确对话。页面上不要出现其他文字。\n\n分镜 1（左上）– 开篇的孤独：\n傍晚，一个小而温馨的游乐场，夕阳西下，柔和的橙色光线。远景。Gugu 企鹅独自坐在沙坑边缘，肩膀下垂，企鹅脚悬空，身边放着一个微弱发光的小灯笼玩具。背景是略显模糊的空秋千。Gugu 的对话气泡：“我的光芒太微弱了……根本没人注意到我。”\n\n分镜 2（中上）– 近景的悲伤：\n中景，拉近 Gugu。灯笼的光在玩偶服上显得很微弱。Gugu 看着灯笼里的倒影，眼眶湿润。背景大部分仍是空的。Gugu 的对话气泡：“也许我应该把它藏起来。”\n\n分镜 3（右上）– 初次接触：\n同样的游乐场，中景双人镜头。Sunny 小鸡拿着一串小纸星星从侧面摇摇晃晃地走进画面，神情友善且好奇。Gugu 抬头，感到惊讶。暖色调，夕阳在他们身后。Sunny 的对话气泡：“嘿……我注意到了。你的光芒指引我来到这里。”\n\n分镜 4（左下）– 坐在一起：\n双人镜头，Gugu 和 Sunny 现在并排坐在沙坑边缘，灯笼在他们中间，在玩偶服上投下柔和的光芒。背景公园灯光开始出现，形成点点虚化光斑。Sunny 的肢体语言开放且友好。Gugu 的对话气泡：“真的吗？我觉得它没那么亮。”\n\n分镜 5（中下）– 温柔的安慰：\n稍微拉近 Sunny 和 Gugu。Sunny 凑近，温柔地微笑着，一只像翅膀一样的手臂指向灯笼。灯笼的光亮了一些。Sunny 的对话气泡：“它足够亮，让我找到了你。”\n\n分镜 6（右下）– 第一部分悬念：\n中近景双人镜头，灯笼位于他们脸部中间。Gugu 看起来有些不确定，但充满希望。Sunny 的眼睛在暖光下闪闪发光。背景虚化。Gugu 的对话气泡：“但如果它不足以帮助任何人怎么办？”没有其他文字；将这个情感悬念留在第一部分的结尾。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18321.jpg"]},{"i":10239,"text":"一位 {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"年轻女孩\"} 在 {argument name=\"location\" default=\"便利店\"} 内，俯拍视角，略带广角，侧头向上看，表情自然柔和，黑色短直发，刘海微湿，手里拿着一袋红色薯片，姿态俏皮自然，身穿 {argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"黑色服装\"}，展现休闲街头风格，站在狭窄的过道中，周围是摆放整齐的零食和饮料，两侧均为货架，展示架靠近大窗户，温暖的金色夕阳透过窗户射入，在商品和她的脸上投下柔和的橙色高光和长长的阴影，皮肤散发自然光泽，舒适的傍晚氛围，电影级构图，柔和对比度，细腻的胶片颗粒感，真实的质感，高细节，浅景深，轻微鱼眼畸变，杂志摄影风格，抓拍瞬间，暖色调，怀旧氛围","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18322.jpg"]}];